meta {
  name: validation
}

docs {
  Resource-server-side requests against the mock token-validator: health
  check, `/validate` token introspection, and mock FHIR reads/writes gated
  by scope and `fhirContext`. Demonstrates what a real FHIR server is
  expected to enforce given the claims the AS issues (signature/`iss`/
  `exp`/`aud`, SMART scopes, `fhirContext`, `organization_reference`).

  Most requests here depend on a token obtained in `auth/` first — see
  each request's own docs block for which one and which environment
  variable it reads.
}
